<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - U Ming TBN - 59,000 tonnes coal Newcastle/Taiwan 24/11-7/12 $7.30 fio 25,000 shinc/20,000 shinc Taipower.</p>
<p>Apollo TBN - 59,000 tonnes Newcastle/Taiwan 21/11-4/12 27/11-10/12 17-30/12 18-31/12 $7.16 fio 25,000 shinc/20,000 shinc Taipower.</p>
<p>U Ming TBN - two trips 59,000 tonnes Richards Bay/Taiwan 17-30/12 $8.69 fio 18-31/12 $8.79 scale load/20,000 shinc Taipower.</p>
<p>Anafi - 60,000 tonnes Richards Bay/Continent 1-10/11 $8.10 fio Samsun.</p>
</text>
